          "comment": "# Comfy Depth Map- Depth Anything 3\n\nUpload 1 image to generate a depth map for video depth estimation. Output a single depth-processed image ready for use in downstream workflows. Ideal for video generation tasks requiring depth control, 3D scene preprocessing, and animation depth mapping. Runs on Comfy Cloud and needs a COMFY_API_KEY.\n\n**How it works:** The Comfy nodes form the complete template graph. Run submits the graph to Comfy Cloud and saves its outputs.\n\n**Try this:** Change the prompt or the Load node inputs and run again to compare results.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/1ae390968e323dba24a6991d1860ded051f5a79b/templates/utility_depth_anything3_video_depth_estimation.json (MIT). Model licenses apply separately."
